        </p>

        <p class="font-poppins">
          James Button was appointed Associate Principal Oboe of the San
          Francisco Symphony in September 2017. A native of Australia, he made
          his solo debut with the Melbourne Symphony at the age of 17. He later
          attended Temple University and the Juilliard School under the tutelage
          of Jonathan Blumenfeld and Eugene Izotov respectively. He has also
          studied with John Mack, John de Lancie, and Joseph Turner.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>Colors</h2>
      <div class="swatches">
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatchBg: #2A6F97;"></div>
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatchBg: #F7F3EE;"></div>
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatchBg: #8FBC8F;"></div>
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatchBg: #333333;"></div>
      </div>
    </header>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .steps p {
    font-size: var(--fontSize);
  }

  .swatches {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr));
    grid-template-rows: 100px;
  }

  .swatch {
    background-color: var(--swatchBg);
  }
</style>
